WEBVTT

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:09.258
So, how's the newest addition
to our family?

00:01:09.302 --> 00:01:10.667
At the moment, she's stable,

00:01:10.703 --> 00:01:12.432
but the prognosis isn't clear.

00:01:12.472 --> 00:01:15.066
Her human physiology has
begun to reassert itself...

00:01:15.108 --> 00:01:18.976
respiratory system, neurological
functions, immune response.

00:01:19.012 --> 00:01:20.843
But those systems are swarming

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:21.972
with Borg implants.

00:01:22.082 --> 00:01:24.676
There's a battle being
waged inside her body

00:01:24.717 --> 00:01:27.117
between the biological
and the technological,

00:01:27.153 --> 00:01:28.620
and I'm not sure
which is going to win.

00:01:28.655 --> 00:01:30.714
Well, it's time
we brought her up-to-date.

00:01:30.757 --> 00:01:31.883
Wake her.

00:01:44.237 --> 00:01:46.899
Captain Janeway.

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:48.339
What have you?

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:58.383
The others;
I can't hear the others.

00:01:58.418 --> 00:01:59.749
The voices are gone.

00:01:59.786 --> 00:02:02.414
We had to neutralize
the neuro-transceiver

00:02:02.455 --> 00:02:04.286
in your upper spinal column.

00:02:04.324 --> 00:02:07.225
Your link to the collective
has been severed.

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:10.957
You will return this drone
to the Borg.

00:02:11.064 --> 00:02:12.463
I'm afraid I can't do that.

00:02:12.499 --> 00:02:15.263
You will return this drone
to the Borg!

00:02:15.301 --> 00:02:17.132
If I were to turn
this ship around

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:18.967
and head back
into Borg territory,

00:02:19.038 --> 00:02:20.369
I'd be putting my crew at risk.

00:02:20.406 --> 00:02:21.896
I'm not prepared to do that.

00:02:21.941 --> 00:02:24.501
Try to understand.

00:02:24.544 --> 00:02:27.274
You have to stay
on board Voyager,

00:02:27.313 --> 00:02:29.873
but I'm offering you freedom
from the collective,

00:02:29.916 --> 00:02:31.144
and I assure you,
we'll do everything

00:02:31.184 --> 00:02:32.276
we can to help the transition...

00:02:32.318 --> 00:02:34.946
You will supply us
with a subspace transmitter

00:02:34.988 --> 00:02:37.616
and leave us
on the nearest planet.

00:02:37.657 --> 00:02:39.284
The Borg will come for us.

00:02:39.325 --> 00:02:40.519
It's too late for that.

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:42.994
Your human cells
are starting to regenerate.

00:02:43.096 --> 00:02:45.587
You won't survive
without medical care.

00:02:45.632 --> 00:02:48.328
We need nothing from you.

00:02:48.368 --> 00:02:51.496
We are Borg.

00:02:51.538 --> 00:02:53.005
We ar...

00:02:57.810 --> 00:02:59.835
This implant is being rejected
by the tissue underneath.

00:02:59.879 --> 00:03:01.642
It's going to have
to be removed.

00:03:01.681 --> 00:03:04.445
You will suppress
the human immune system!

00:03:04.484 --> 00:03:06.281
I'm sorry, but the process
has gone too far.

00:03:06.319 --> 00:03:07.650
We've got to get you
to Sick Bay.

00:03:07.687 --> 00:03:09.951
No! We are Borg!

00:03:10.056 --> 00:03:12.490
We are Borg!

00:05:09.508 --> 00:05:11.499
This armor plating
is anchored to the skull

00:05:11.543 --> 00:05:13.306
with over 3 million
microconnectors.

00:05:13.345 --> 00:05:14.744
There's no time
to cut through them.

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:17.044
I'm going to have to remove the
outer layer of the skull itself.

00:05:17.082 --> 00:05:20.848
Lieutenant, will you please
leave the surgical bay!

00:05:20.886 --> 00:05:22.786
This Borg is a security risk.

00:05:22.821 --> 00:05:23.810
She is heavily sedated.

00:05:23.855 --> 00:05:26.153
I assure you,
she's not going anywhere.

00:05:31.063 --> 00:05:33.122
Thank you.

00:05:33.165 --> 00:05:36.965
Kes, I want you to anesthetize
her cranial nerves.

00:05:37.035 --> 00:05:38.662
20 milligrams anetrizine.

00:05:38.704 --> 00:05:39.728
Yes, Doctor.

00:05:42.708 --> 00:05:44.175
Kes?

00:05:44.209 --> 00:05:46.370
I don't know what happened.

00:05:46.411 --> 00:05:48.777
I looked at the hypospray,
and it just came to me.

00:05:48.814 --> 00:05:51.806
Have you been experimenting with
your psychokinetic abilities?

00:05:51.850 --> 00:05:53.283
No, not for months.

00:05:53.318 --> 00:05:55.980
But I have been feeling
a little strange lately...

00:05:56.054 --> 00:05:57.851
lots of energy, sleeping less...

00:05:57.889 --> 00:05:59.356
I can see why.

00:05:59.391 --> 00:06:02.155
Your serotonin levels are
62 percent above normal.

00:06:04.262 --> 00:06:05.854
It's the telepathic centers
of your brain.

00:06:05.897 --> 00:06:07.558
They're in a state
of hyperstimulation,

00:06:07.599 --> 00:06:09.362
like they were a few days ago,

00:06:09.401 --> 00:06:11.767
when you were in contact
with Species 8472.

00:06:11.803 --> 00:06:13.600
Are they attempting
to communicate with you again?

00:06:13.638 --> 00:06:15.606
No.

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:16.902
This time, it's different.

00:06:16.942 --> 00:06:18.375
I don't feel their presence
at all.

00:06:18.410 --> 00:06:21.641
Perhaps she's experiencing
an aftereffect of some kind.

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:23.113
A reasonable diagnosis...

00:06:23.148 --> 00:06:24.445
for a security officer.

00:06:24.483 --> 00:06:26.917
I'll run a full
microsynaptic analysis,

00:06:26.952 --> 00:06:28.180
but it will have to wait.

00:06:28.220 --> 00:06:29.983
We should get back to our Borg.

00:06:43.468 --> 00:06:44.799
Come in.

00:06:45.837 --> 00:06:47.361
Ship's status report.

00:06:47.405 --> 00:06:50.306
We've got two teams on the hull
stripping off the Borg armor.

00:06:50.342 --> 00:06:51.900
They're working
around the clock,

00:06:51.943 --> 00:06:53.205
but it's still slow going.

00:06:53.245 --> 00:06:54.712
What about the warp drive?

00:06:54.746 --> 00:06:57.510
Torres is having problems
cleaning out the plasma relays.

00:06:57.549 --> 00:06:59.915
It's disrupting
the antimatter reaction.

00:06:59.951 --> 00:07:02.613
Until she's got it fixed,
we're stuck at impulse.

00:07:02.654 --> 00:07:04.019
She's requesting all personnel

00:07:04.055 --> 00:07:05.613
with a level-3
engineering rating or higher

00:07:05.657 --> 00:07:06.885
to lend a hand.

00:07:06.925 --> 00:07:08.722
Granted.

00:07:08.760 --> 00:07:09.886
Tactical update?

00:07:09.928 --> 00:07:11.919
Long-range sensors
are picking up

00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:14.897
residual transwarp signatures...
Borg vessels.

00:07:14.933 --> 00:07:17.424
They passed by
probably three days ago.

00:07:17.469 --> 00:07:20.597
So we're not
out of the woods yet.

00:07:20.639 --> 00:07:22.766
Having half our propulsion
system overrun by Borg implants

00:07:22.808 --> 00:07:24.105
doesn't make repairs
any easier.

00:07:26.011 --> 00:07:28.241
Seven of Nine
could help us with that.

00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:30.305
That might be true,
if she were willing,

00:07:30.348 --> 00:07:32.748
but she's not in
the most cooperative mood.

00:07:32.784 --> 00:07:36.185
That could change.

00:07:36.221 --> 00:07:38.621
I just have to reach her
somehow.

00:07:41.359 --> 00:07:43.520
Annika Hansen.

00:07:43.562 --> 00:07:45.291
Our Borg?

00:07:45.330 --> 00:07:47.161
It took some digging

00:07:47.199 --> 00:07:48.598
through the Federation database,

00:07:48.633 --> 00:07:50.260
but I managed to find
a single entry

00:07:50.302 --> 00:07:52.202
in the records of Deep Space 4.

00:07:53.972 --> 00:07:56.702
Her parents were...
unconventional.

00:07:56.741 --> 00:07:58.971
They fancied themselves
explorers,

00:07:59.044 --> 00:08:00.602
but wanted nothing to do
with Starfleet

00:08:00.645 --> 00:08:01.612
or the Federation.

00:08:01.646 --> 00:08:03.375
Their names were last recorded

00:08:03.415 --> 00:08:06.851
at a remote outpost
in the Omega Sector.

00:08:06.885 --> 00:08:09.319
They refused to file
a flight plan.

00:08:10.989 --> 00:08:12.718
Apparently, they aimed
their small ship

00:08:12.757 --> 00:08:15.419
toward the Delta Quadrant,
and were never heard from again.

00:08:15.460 --> 00:08:16.620
For all we know,

00:08:16.661 --> 00:08:18.561
Annika and her parents
were the first humans

00:08:18.597 --> 00:08:21.088
the Borg ever assimilated.

00:08:21.132 --> 00:08:25.535
From what she's told me,
that was almost 20 years ago.

00:08:25.570 --> 00:08:27.663
So she was raised by the Borg.

00:08:27.706 --> 00:08:30.470
It's the only life
she ever really knew.

00:08:30.508 --> 00:08:33.102
If you were thinking of
bringing her into the fold,

00:08:33.144 --> 00:08:34.338
that might not be possible.

00:08:34.379 --> 00:08:37.940
What's the alternative...
toss her back to the wolves?

00:08:38.049 --> 00:08:40.176
Sick Bay to Captain Janeway.

00:08:40.218 --> 00:08:41.412
What is it, Doctor?

00:08:41.453 --> 00:08:42.613
Could you come down here,
Captain?

00:08:42.654 --> 00:08:45.384
We're having some... problems.

00:08:45.423 --> 00:08:46.549
I'll be right there.

00:09:03.808 --> 00:09:06.106
It's like peeling an onion.

00:09:07.412 --> 00:09:09.505
Store it in a biostasis chamber.

00:09:10.982 --> 00:09:12.472
It may still be active.

00:09:12.517 --> 00:09:14.075
If you think
there's a risk, Mr. Tuvok,

00:09:14.119 --> 00:09:16.747
you can throw one of your little
force fields around the chamber.

00:09:17.789 --> 00:09:20.519
A prudent security measure...
for a Doctor.

00:09:23.295 --> 00:09:24.762
Report.

00:09:24.796 --> 00:09:26.821
I'm afraid we have
a decision to make...

00:09:26.865 --> 00:09:29.390
a difficult one.

00:09:29.434 --> 00:09:31.766
Her human immune system
has reasserted itself

00:09:31.803 --> 00:09:34.203
with a vengeance...
body armor, Borg organelles

00:09:34.239 --> 00:09:37.436
biosynthetic glands...
they're all being rejected.

00:09:37.475 --> 00:09:39.136
Her life is in danger.

00:09:39.177 --> 00:09:40.508
I have little recourse

00:09:40.545 --> 00:09:42.604
but to remove
the Borg technology.

00:09:42.647 --> 00:09:45.241
Which is the last thing
Seven of Nine would want.

00:09:45.283 --> 00:09:47.080
Hence, the difficult decision.

00:09:47.118 --> 00:09:49.586
If a patient told me
not to treat them...

00:09:49.621 --> 00:09:51.589
even if the situation
were life-threatening...

00:09:51.623 --> 00:09:54.751
I would be ethically obligated
to honor that request.

00:09:54.793 --> 00:09:57.353
This is no ordinary patient.

00:09:57.395 --> 00:10:00.091
She may have been raised
by Borg,

00:10:00.131 --> 00:10:02.463
raised to think like a Borg...

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:03.967
but she's with us now

00:10:04.002 --> 00:10:05.970
and underneath
all that technology,

00:10:06.071 --> 00:10:08.505
she is a human being...
whether she's

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:11.441
ready to accept that or not.

00:10:11.476 --> 00:10:13.205
And until she is ready,

00:10:13.244 --> 00:10:16.270
someone has to make
the decisions for her.

00:10:19.684 --> 00:10:21.914
Proceed with the surgery.

00:10:21.953 --> 00:10:24.114
Aye, Captain.

00:10:34.299 --> 00:10:35.391
Kes.

00:10:39.004 --> 00:10:41.199
Let's begin
with the microtubule network

00:10:41.239 --> 00:10:43.070
embedded
in the esophageal tract.

00:10:46.277 --> 00:10:47.335
What's happening?

00:10:47.379 --> 00:10:48.846
I'm not sure.

00:10:50.115 --> 00:10:51.480
She's going into neural shock.

00:10:51.516 --> 00:10:53.677
I can't localize the source.

00:10:53.718 --> 00:10:56.186
Kes, try to stabilize
her motor cortex.

00:10:56.221 --> 00:10:57.745
Use a neuro sequencer.

00:10:58.923 --> 00:11:01.483
Kes, I said
to stabilize her cortex

00:11:01.526 --> 00:11:02.493
or we're going to lose her.

00:11:02.527 --> 00:11:03.289
Wait.

00:11:03.328 --> 00:11:05.455
I can see it.

00:11:05.497 --> 00:11:06.862
What?

00:11:06.898 --> 00:11:09.423
I think the problem
is in her colliculi.

00:11:22.480 --> 00:11:25.347
Yes... I can see it.

00:11:25.383 --> 00:11:29.843
A Borg implant... it's pressing
against her trochlear nerve.

00:11:29.888 --> 00:11:32.152
Can you tell me
how we might remove it

00:11:32.190 --> 00:11:33.885
without severing the nerve?

00:11:33.925 --> 00:11:36.359
I think I can do more
than tell you.

00:11:53.511 --> 00:11:55.502
The implant is deteriorating.

00:11:56.848 --> 00:11:59.078
Her nervous system
is stabilizing.

00:12:02.454 --> 00:12:04.319
Nice work, Kes.

00:12:04.355 --> 00:12:06.550
Unconventional...

00:12:06.591 --> 00:12:08.354
but effective.

00:12:23.340 --> 00:12:25.570
They say the eye
is the window to the soul.

00:12:25.609 --> 00:12:28.544
In this case,
it's a little bit more.

00:12:28.579 --> 00:12:30.638
I fabricated
this artificial organ

00:12:30.681 --> 00:12:32.945
to replace her eyepiece,
but I've had

00:12:32.983 --> 00:12:34.780
to retain some
of the Borg circuitry

00:12:34.819 --> 00:12:35.945
along the optic nerve.

00:12:35.986 --> 00:12:38.853
As a result, she'll have
increased acuity in one eye.

00:12:38.889 --> 00:12:40.982
Note how perfectly I've matched

00:12:41.025 --> 00:12:44.188
the pigment of the iris
to her human eye.

00:12:44.228 --> 00:12:45.286
Excellent work, Doctor.

00:12:45.329 --> 00:12:47.194
I admire
your attention to detail.

00:12:47.231 --> 00:12:49.722
When can I speak with her?

00:12:49.767 --> 00:12:52.759
She's out of immediate danger
and I don't plan to resume

00:12:52.803 --> 00:12:54.395
the extraction process
until tomorrow.

00:12:54.438 --> 00:12:56.406
I can wake her now
if you'd like.

00:12:56.440 --> 00:12:57.429
I would.

00:13:00.478 --> 00:13:02.207
How are you, Kes?

00:13:02.246 --> 00:13:03.770
I feel exhilarated, Captain.

00:13:03.814 --> 00:13:05.941
I've never been
so focused in my life.

00:13:06.016 --> 00:13:09.042
And my telepathic abilities are
stronger than they've ever been.

00:13:09.086 --> 00:13:11.850
Your performance today
was astonishing.

00:13:11.889 --> 00:13:15.222
However, your psychokinetic
powers are still undisciplined

00:13:15.259 --> 00:13:17.250
and, as a result, unpredictable.

00:13:17.294 --> 00:13:19.319
I feel like I'm in control.

00:13:19.363 --> 00:13:21.923
Nevertheless, you must
proceed with caution

00:13:21.966 --> 00:13:23.524
and with my assistance.

00:13:23.567 --> 00:13:25.091
What are you suggesting?

00:13:25.135 --> 00:13:29.094
A series of guided meditations
to help her explore the depth

00:13:29.139 --> 00:13:30.572
of these new abilities.

00:13:30.608 --> 00:13:31.666
Kes?

00:13:31.709 --> 00:13:33.973
I'm ready.

00:13:34.044 --> 00:13:38.378
Well, then, if you'll excuse us,
we should begin immediately.

00:13:51.228 --> 00:13:52.559
Ready when you are, Captain.

00:14:05.175 --> 00:14:06.699
Don't be alarmed.

00:14:06.744 --> 00:14:07.802
You're in Sick Bay.

00:14:07.845 --> 00:14:09.278
You're going to be fine.

00:14:14.385 --> 00:14:16.945
What have you done to me?!

00:14:16.987 --> 00:14:19.547
Your body was rejecting
the Borg technology.

00:14:19.590 --> 00:14:20.579
You were dying.

00:14:20.624 --> 00:14:23.320
I'm sorry, but we had no choice.

00:14:23.360 --> 00:14:25.624
Those are dermaplastic grafts.

00:14:25.663 --> 00:14:27.756
They'll help
the regeneration process.

00:14:30.701 --> 00:14:32.635
Unacceptable.

00:14:39.476 --> 00:14:42.502
You should have let us die.

00:14:44.615 --> 00:14:46.082
I couldn't do that.

00:14:46.116 --> 00:14:48.846
This drone cannot survive
outside the collective.

00:14:48.886 --> 00:14:50.319
I beg to differ.

00:14:50.354 --> 00:14:52.515
Now that the Borg implants
are being excised,

00:14:52.556 --> 00:14:55.423
your human systems are free
to thrive and thriving they are.

00:14:55.459 --> 00:14:56.949
As a matter of fact, I...

00:15:00.130 --> 00:15:01.688
I want to help you,

00:15:01.732 --> 00:15:03.927
but I need to understand
what you're going through.

00:15:03.968 --> 00:15:05.128
Do not engage us

00:15:05.169 --> 00:15:07.330
in superficial
attempts at sympathy.

00:15:07.371 --> 00:15:09.532
It's obvious
that you're in pain,

00:15:09.573 --> 00:15:10.631
that you're frightened,

00:15:10.674 --> 00:15:13.939
that you feel isolated, alone.

00:15:14.011 --> 00:15:16.502
You are an individual.

00:15:18.549 --> 00:15:20.744
You are small.

00:15:20.784 --> 00:15:25.448
You cannot understand
what it is to be Borg.

00:15:25.489 --> 00:15:28.617
No, but I can imagine.

00:15:30.394 --> 00:15:33.295
You were part
of a vast consciousness,

00:15:33.330 --> 00:15:36.094
billions of minds
working together,

00:15:36.133 --> 00:15:38.397
a harmony
of purpose and thought...

00:15:38.435 --> 00:15:40.630
no indecision, no doubts.

00:15:40.671 --> 00:15:44.801
The security and strength
of a unified will...

00:15:46.010 --> 00:15:47.807
and you've lost that.

00:15:50.881 --> 00:15:54.146
This drone is small now.

00:15:54.184 --> 00:15:55.913
Alone.

00:15:58.622 --> 00:15:59.987
One voice.

00:16:00.090 --> 00:16:01.921
One mind.

00:16:03.160 --> 00:16:05.060
The silence is unacceptable.

00:16:05.095 --> 00:16:06.392
We need the others.

00:16:06.430 --> 00:16:08.159
I can't give you
back to the Borg,

00:16:08.198 --> 00:16:09.529
but you're not alone.

00:16:09.566 --> 00:16:11.693
You're part
of a human community now...

00:16:11.735 --> 00:16:13.669
a human collective.

00:16:13.704 --> 00:16:16.935
We may be individuals,
but we live and work together.

00:16:17.007 --> 00:16:20.135
You can have some
of the unity you require

00:16:20.177 --> 00:16:21.906
right here on Voyager.

00:16:25.049 --> 00:16:26.107
Insufficient.

00:16:27.351 --> 00:16:28.943
It'll have to do.

00:16:31.188 --> 00:16:34.248
And the fact is,
this community needs you.

00:16:34.291 --> 00:16:37.158
The Borg modifications
you made to our vessel

00:16:37.194 --> 00:16:39.424
are disrupting our warp drive.

00:16:39.463 --> 00:16:41.488
We need your help
to remove them...

00:16:43.200 --> 00:16:45.930
your... expertise.

00:16:45.969 --> 00:16:47.800
Your cooperation.

00:16:50.407 --> 00:16:53.069
You must comply.

00:16:57.748 --> 00:16:59.375
All right.

00:16:59.416 --> 00:17:01.247
I think I've got
all the Borg garbage

00:17:01.285 --> 00:17:02.912
out of the plasma
intake manifold.

00:17:03.020 --> 00:17:05.284
Let's try reinitializing
the antimatter reaction.

00:17:13.230 --> 00:17:18.065
Matter/antimatter reaction
at 22 Cochranes and rising.

00:17:22.873 --> 00:17:25.034
Damn! What happened?

00:17:25.075 --> 00:17:28.306
Intake manifolds 11 and 13
are still blocked.

00:17:28.345 --> 00:17:29.539
This is like pulling weeds.

00:17:29.580 --> 00:17:31.104
You think you've got
them all out, and then...

00:17:31.148 --> 00:17:32.775
You have neglected
to remove the autonomous

00:17:32.816 --> 00:17:34.579
regeneration sequencers.

00:17:34.618 --> 00:17:38.110
Lieutenant Torres, Ensign Kim,
you remember Seven of Nine.

00:17:38.155 --> 00:17:40.316
How could we forget?

00:17:40.357 --> 00:17:42.484
We can't afford to delay
repairs any longer.

00:17:42.526 --> 00:17:45.689
So I've asked her to help us
remove the Borg modifications.

00:17:45.729 --> 00:17:47.754
She only has a few hours
before she returns to Sick Bay.

00:17:47.798 --> 00:17:49.527
I suggest you
put her to good use.

00:17:49.566 --> 00:17:51.193
You can start
with the plasma relays.

00:17:51.235 --> 00:17:52.463
They're in Jefferies Tube 13...

00:17:52.503 --> 00:17:55.131
Jefferies Tube
13-Alpha, Section 12.

00:17:55.172 --> 00:17:57.197
We fully recall
the engineering specifications

00:17:57.241 --> 00:17:58.333
of your vessel.

00:17:58.375 --> 00:18:01.003
Good. Can you also recall
the way it looked

00:18:01.044 --> 00:18:03.274
before you turned it
into a Borg circus?

00:18:04.515 --> 00:18:05.539
Yes.

00:18:07.251 --> 00:18:09.185
Well, now that the pleasantries
are over,

00:18:09.219 --> 00:18:10.447
why don't you get to work?

00:18:10.487 --> 00:18:12.648
I want updates every hour.

00:18:12.689 --> 00:18:15.123
Yes, Captain.

00:18:21.598 --> 00:18:24.465
The flame of the lamp
is fire disciplined...

00:18:24.501 --> 00:18:27.129
tamed and under control.

00:18:27.171 --> 00:18:30.868
It is the appropriate focus
for the task ahead of us.

00:18:30.908 --> 00:18:32.842
How do we begin?

00:18:32.876 --> 00:18:36.744
I will attempt to guide you
in manipulating the flame

00:18:36.780 --> 00:18:38.247
at the subatomic level.

00:18:40.284 --> 00:18:45.221
Concentrate on the flame...
try to see past

00:18:45.255 --> 00:18:47.951
the surface...
past the light...

00:18:48.058 --> 00:18:50.686
to the patterns
of energy and matter.

00:18:54.731 --> 00:18:57.359
I can see the essence
of the fire.

00:18:57.401 --> 00:18:58.368
Good.

00:18:58.402 --> 00:19:00.529
Now, reach out with your mind

00:19:00.571 --> 00:19:01.663
and intensify the flame.

00:19:13.350 --> 00:19:15.614
I'm making it hotter,
brighter.

00:19:16.620 --> 00:19:19.817
Now, with your thoughts...

00:19:19.857 --> 00:19:21.085
reduce the flame.

00:19:30.801 --> 00:19:32.393
Excellent.

00:19:32.436 --> 00:19:36.338
You've never demonstrated
this level of control before.

00:19:36.373 --> 00:19:40.639
It's as though I knew
what had to be done and...

00:19:43.447 --> 00:19:44.414
What's wrong?

00:19:44.448 --> 00:19:46.348
Something's happening.

00:19:47.885 --> 00:19:50.786
I can see further,
beyond the subatomic.

00:19:52.222 --> 00:19:55.714
Kes, there is nothing
beyond the subatomic.

00:19:55.759 --> 00:19:57.920
But I can see it, Tuvok.

00:20:03.400 --> 00:20:05.868
It's a new level of reality.

00:20:07.371 --> 00:20:08.736
It's beautiful.

00:20:11.441 --> 00:20:14.467
Perhaps we should stop for now.

00:20:14.511 --> 00:20:16.138
Wait a few seconds.

00:20:16.179 --> 00:20:18.079
I want to try to control it.

00:20:29.026 --> 00:20:30.755
Don't worry, Tuvok.

00:20:42.839 --> 00:20:44.773
What about these linkages?

00:20:44.807 --> 00:20:45.933
Every time I pull one out,

00:20:45.975 --> 00:20:47.442
another one
comes back in its place.

00:20:47.477 --> 00:20:49.775
Autonomous regeneration
sequencers.

00:20:49.812 --> 00:20:51.871
They function
to counteract resistance.

00:20:51.914 --> 00:20:52.938
Amazing.

00:20:52.982 --> 00:20:53.949
How did you come up

00:20:53.983 --> 00:20:55.348
with the pattern-
duplication design?

00:20:55.385 --> 00:20:56.682
We came up with nothing.

00:20:56.719 --> 00:20:58.653
The Borg assimilated
this technology

00:20:58.688 --> 00:21:00.918
in Galactic Cluster 3
from Species 259.

00:21:00.957 --> 00:21:03.357
I'm not interested
in a history lesson.

00:21:03.393 --> 00:21:04.860
How do we disable it?

00:21:04.894 --> 00:21:07.192
You must disconnect
each sequencer conduit

00:21:07.230 --> 00:21:08.720
at the insertion juncture.

00:21:08.765 --> 00:21:10.426
Why don't you two work
in the Jefferies tube?

00:21:10.466 --> 00:21:12.127
Start with the plasma relays.

00:21:17.106 --> 00:21:18.368
I'll start here.

00:21:25.047 --> 00:21:28.710
You said the Borg got this stuff
from Species 259.

00:21:28.751 --> 00:21:30.343
Who were they?

00:21:34.957 --> 00:21:37.482
I guess the Borg meet
a lot of people, don't they?

00:21:40.463 --> 00:21:41.657
Stupid question.

00:21:45.735 --> 00:21:48.727
So what's it like out there
in Galactic Cluster 3?

00:21:48.771 --> 00:21:51.501
Beyond your comprehension.

00:21:51.541 --> 00:21:53.008
Try me.

00:21:55.344 --> 00:21:58.677
Galactic Cluster 3
is a transmaterial energy plane

00:21:58.714 --> 00:22:01.774
intersecting 22 billion
omnicordial life-forms.

00:22:03.352 --> 00:22:06.253
Oh. Interesting.

00:22:24.140 --> 00:22:26.040
Ensign Kim, your assistance.

00:22:32.014 --> 00:22:34.539
Captain, somebody's
trying to access

00:22:34.584 --> 00:22:36.415
the subspace transmitter.

00:22:38.754 --> 00:22:39.914
Captain, I don't know how,

00:22:39.956 --> 00:22:42.686
but she's erected some kind
of force field around the door.

00:22:42.725 --> 00:22:43.919
We can't break through it.

00:22:43.960 --> 00:22:45.325
She's bypassed
our security protocols.

00:22:45.361 --> 00:22:47.556
Disable the transmitter.

00:22:47.597 --> 00:22:49.462
It's too late.

00:22:49.499 --> 00:22:51.990
It's obvious your mental
abilities have progressed

00:22:52.034 --> 00:22:54.002
beyond this particular
Vulcan exercise.

00:22:54.036 --> 00:22:55.367
I suggest we...

00:22:58.407 --> 00:22:59.374
What is it?

00:22:59.408 --> 00:23:00.568
Something's wrong.

00:23:02.979 --> 00:23:06.039
The Borg is trying
to contact her people.

00:23:07.416 --> 00:23:09.611
Tuvok to Security Team 1.

00:23:09.652 --> 00:23:11.210
Intruder alert in Engineering.

00:23:12.321 --> 00:23:13.811
Wait.

00:23:13.856 --> 00:23:15.756
I think I can stop her.

00:23:34.510 --> 00:23:36.205
It's over.

00:23:37.680 --> 00:23:38.772
Tuvok to Bridge.

00:23:38.814 --> 00:23:39.974
Status?

00:23:40.016 --> 00:23:42.177
There was some kind of explosion
in the Jefferies tube

00:23:42.218 --> 00:23:44.277
just as she was about
to initiate her transmission.

00:23:44.320 --> 00:23:46.754
We don't know what caused it.

00:23:46.789 --> 00:23:49.690
I believe I may
have the answer, Captain.

00:23:59.135 --> 00:24:01.160
I can tell by the expression
on your face,

00:24:01.203 --> 00:24:02.636
that you've got some bad news.

00:24:02.672 --> 00:24:05.106
I have no expression on my face.

00:24:05.141 --> 00:24:07.302
However, you are correct.

00:24:07.343 --> 00:24:09.868
The news on two separate fronts
is not good.

00:24:09.912 --> 00:24:12.210
I checked
the subspace bandwidths.

00:24:12.248 --> 00:24:14.944
At least a partial signal
was transmitted from Voyager.

00:24:15.051 --> 00:24:16.780
Enough for a Borg ship to track?

00:24:16.819 --> 00:24:17.786
Possibly.

00:24:17.820 --> 00:24:18.946
And the second front?

00:24:19.055 --> 00:24:22.286
I believe there's also
cause for concern regarding Kes.

00:24:22.325 --> 00:24:23.383
Explain.

00:24:24.460 --> 00:24:26.553
Internal sensor logs show
that she destabilized

00:24:26.596 --> 00:24:28.791
the Jefferies tube
at the molecular level.

00:24:28.831 --> 00:24:29.923
The effect weakened

00:24:29.966 --> 00:24:31.695
the infrastructure
throughout the deck.

00:24:31.734 --> 00:24:35.135
She wishes to develop
her abilities further.

00:24:35.171 --> 00:24:37.731
I am not certain
it would be safe...

00:24:37.773 --> 00:24:39.400
for Kes or Voyager.

00:24:39.442 --> 00:24:42.138
I've got an Ocampan
who wants to be something more

00:24:42.178 --> 00:24:44.510
and a Borg who's afraid
of becoming something less.

00:24:44.547 --> 00:24:46.071
Here's to Vulcan stability.

00:24:48.150 --> 00:24:49.447
Wait for me.

00:25:02.865 --> 00:25:05.595
So this is human freedom.

00:25:05.635 --> 00:25:07.899
I've decided to keep you
in the brig

00:25:07.937 --> 00:25:10.929
until I'm certain
you won't try to harm us again.

00:25:11.007 --> 00:25:13.703
If necessary, the Doctor
can treat you here.

00:25:14.877 --> 00:25:17.471
I honestly believed
you were going to help us.

00:25:17.513 --> 00:25:19.947
You were not deceived,
Captain Janeway.

00:25:20.016 --> 00:25:22.109
It was my intention to help you.

00:25:22.151 --> 00:25:23.709
What happened?

00:25:23.753 --> 00:25:26.347
There was a chance
to contact the collective.

00:25:26.389 --> 00:25:27.788
I took advantage of it.

00:25:31.594 --> 00:25:35.860
Your attempts to assimilate
this drone will fail.

00:25:35.898 --> 00:25:38.423
You can alter our physiology,

00:25:38.467 --> 00:25:41.436
but you cannot
change our nature.

00:25:41.470 --> 00:25:43.631
We will betray you.

00:25:43.673 --> 00:25:45.800
We are Borg.

00:25:47.243 --> 00:25:50.679
I've met Borg who were freed
from the collective.

00:25:50.713 --> 00:25:53.944
It wasn't easy for them
to accept their individuality,

00:25:53.983 --> 00:25:55.917
but, in time, they did.

00:25:55.951 --> 00:25:57.578
You're no different.

00:25:57.620 --> 00:26:00.350
Granted, you were assimilated
at a very young age

00:26:00.389 --> 00:26:02.084
and your transition
may be more difficult,

00:26:02.124 --> 00:26:04.718
but it will happen.

00:26:12.134 --> 00:26:18.505
If it does happen,
we will become fully human?

00:26:18.541 --> 00:26:21.476
Yes, I hope so.

00:26:22.645 --> 00:26:26.172
We will be autonomous,
independent.

00:26:26.215 --> 00:26:31.517
That's what individuality
is all about.

00:26:31.554 --> 00:26:36.753
If at that time, we choose
to return to the collective,

00:26:36.792 --> 00:26:39.022
will you permit it?

00:26:41.397 --> 00:26:44.332
I don't think
you'll want to do that.

00:26:49.939 --> 00:26:53.966
You would deny us the choice,

00:26:54.043 --> 00:26:56.068
as you deny us now.

00:26:56.112 --> 00:26:59.570
You have imprisoned us
in the name of humanity,

00:26:59.615 --> 00:27:01.048
yet you will not grant us

00:27:01.083 --> 00:27:03.381
your most "cherished"
human right...

00:27:03.419 --> 00:27:06.252
to choose our own fate.

00:27:07.456 --> 00:27:11.415
You are hypocritical,
manipulative.

00:27:12.828 --> 00:27:17.197
We do not want to be
what you are!

00:27:17.233 --> 00:27:18.723
Return us to the collective!

00:27:19.835 --> 00:27:22.235
You lost the capacity
to make a rational choice

00:27:22.271 --> 00:27:23.863
the moment you were assimilated.

00:27:23.906 --> 00:27:25.874
They took that from you.

00:27:25.908 --> 00:27:28.877
And until I'm convinced you've
gotten it back...

00:27:28.911 --> 00:27:31.345
I'm making the choice for you.

00:27:31.380 --> 00:27:33.905
You're staying here.

00:27:33.949 --> 00:27:37.851
Then you are no different
than the Borg.

00:27:43.992 --> 00:27:46.222
Talaxian champagne.

00:27:46.261 --> 00:27:48.058
Moon-ripened.

00:27:48.096 --> 00:27:49.961
Your favorite.

00:27:50.031 --> 00:27:51.965
Neelix, where did you get this?

00:27:52.066 --> 00:27:54.660
I put a bottle away...

00:27:54.702 --> 00:27:57.967
for a special occasion.

00:27:58.006 --> 00:28:01.066
Remember when we last
sipped this together?

00:28:01.109 --> 00:28:03.509
Three years ago.

00:28:03.545 --> 00:28:05.740
It was when we first
arrived on Voyager.

00:28:05.780 --> 00:28:07.907
And do you remember
the toast I made?

00:28:08.016 --> 00:28:10.644
Yes.
"To the adventure."

00:28:10.685 --> 00:28:12.880
"To the adventure."

00:28:19.727 --> 00:28:21.854
When you left Ocampa,

00:28:21.896 --> 00:28:25.423
you said that your people
were being held back.

00:28:25.466 --> 00:28:26.933
That if you were
only given the chance,

00:28:26.968 --> 00:28:29.869
you could become
something so much more.

00:28:29.904 --> 00:28:31.929
And you have.

00:28:32.040 --> 00:28:35.100
I know things haven't worked out
exactly the way we planned.

00:28:35.143 --> 00:28:37.475
I was only holding you back.

00:28:38.780 --> 00:28:40.941
That's obvious to me now.

00:28:40.982 --> 00:28:43.314
No. I couldn't have come
this far without you.

00:28:46.754 --> 00:28:48.847
And I love you.

00:28:48.890 --> 00:28:51.484
I always will.

00:28:51.526 --> 00:28:53.858
It's just, uh...

00:28:58.933 --> 00:29:01.766
My cooking.
You've always hated my cooking.

00:29:02.804 --> 00:29:04.294
That's exactly what it was.

00:29:06.941 --> 00:29:09.603
Ah...

00:29:09.644 --> 00:29:12.807
So tell me more
about what's happening to you.

00:29:12.847 --> 00:29:14.371
What does it all mean?

00:29:14.415 --> 00:29:18.715
I don't know, and that's
what makes it so exciting.

00:29:18.753 --> 00:29:20.311
It's as if I can see
into a place

00:29:20.355 --> 00:29:26.453
where the distinction between
matter and energy and thought

00:29:26.494 --> 00:29:27.688
no longer exists.

00:29:27.729 --> 00:29:30.664
And that's only the beginning.

00:29:30.698 --> 00:29:33.098
I feel as if all the boundaries
within me

00:29:33.134 --> 00:29:34.499
are about to fall away.

00:29:34.535 --> 00:29:36.230
It sounds...

00:29:39.841 --> 00:29:41.900
er... uh... interesting.

00:29:41.943 --> 00:29:43.740
I only have to look
at an object,

00:29:43.778 --> 00:29:46.941
gaze at it,
and I can begin to see...

00:29:46.981 --> 00:29:49.472
that the space between the atoms

00:29:49.517 --> 00:29:52.486
is being filled
with something else.

00:29:56.057 --> 00:29:57.752
Uh, Kes...

00:29:57.792 --> 00:30:00.420
I can see... I see...

00:30:05.466 --> 00:30:07.058
Uh, Kes, stop!

00:30:07.101 --> 00:30:08.068
No.

00:30:09.771 --> 00:30:10.829
Neelix!

00:30:12.440 --> 00:30:14.704
Captain, I'm picking up
some strange energy readings

00:30:14.742 --> 00:30:15.970
from Deck 2, the Mess Hall.

00:30:16.010 --> 00:30:17.944
Bridge to Neelix.
What's going on down there?

00:30:19.414 --> 00:30:20.506
Neelix, report.

00:30:20.548 --> 00:30:22.516
The bulkhead in that section
is coming apart.

00:30:22.550 --> 00:30:24.882
Increase the structural
integrity field of Deck 2.

00:30:24.919 --> 00:30:26.011
Tuvok.

00:30:56.551 --> 00:30:59.452
I've run every conceivable
neural analysis...

00:30:59.487 --> 00:31:02.217
everything short
of dissecting the brain itself.

00:31:02.256 --> 00:31:04.656
Her telesynaptic
activity is increasing,

00:31:04.692 --> 00:31:07.126
but I don't know why,
or how to stop it.

00:31:07.161 --> 00:31:10.062
Have the ship's internal
sensors revealed anything?

00:31:10.098 --> 00:31:12.464
For 17.4 seconds,
Kes's body went

00:31:12.500 --> 00:31:14.661
into a state of cellular flux.

00:31:14.702 --> 00:31:17.569
She began to destabilize
at the subatomic level.

00:31:17.605 --> 00:31:19.129
And for some reason,

00:31:19.173 --> 00:31:20.970
her atoms
reestablished their bonds

00:31:21.008 --> 00:31:22.475
and she was back in one piece.

00:31:22.510 --> 00:31:24.068
But what about the next time?

00:31:24.112 --> 00:31:25.636
Her condition is escalating.

00:31:25.680 --> 00:31:27.375
We must find
a way to suppress it

00:31:27.415 --> 00:31:29.440
or the last we'll see of Kes
could very well be

00:31:29.484 --> 00:31:31.748
her molecules blowing
through the ventilation ducts.

00:31:31.786 --> 00:31:34.482
Tuvok, enhance the structural
integrity fields

00:31:34.522 --> 00:31:35.716
throughout the ship.

00:31:35.757 --> 00:31:38.920
If she has another incident,
I'd like to avoid a hull breach.

00:31:38.960 --> 00:31:43.954
Doctor, maybe it's time
we broaden our horizons.

00:31:43.998 --> 00:31:47.229
This appears to have gone
beyond medical science.

00:31:47.268 --> 00:31:49.168
We're into particle physics now.

00:31:49.203 --> 00:31:50.170
I'll try looking

00:31:50.204 --> 00:31:51.967
through the quantum
substructure database.

00:31:52.006 --> 00:31:54.497
Maybe it'll give me
some... inspiration.

00:31:54.542 --> 00:31:55.873
Keep me informed.

00:32:06.320 --> 00:32:10.518
Kes, until I can devise
another diagnostic procedure,

00:32:10.558 --> 00:32:12.389
you're free to return
to your quarters.

00:32:12.427 --> 00:32:15.089
Actually, I'd like to stay here,
help with the research.

00:32:15.129 --> 00:32:17.290
I don't want you
to overexert yourself

00:32:17.331 --> 00:32:20.357
and risk precipitating
another telepathic incident.

00:32:20.401 --> 00:32:21.732
Try to get some rest.

00:32:21.769 --> 00:32:24.067
Just let me stay a little while.

00:32:24.105 --> 00:32:26.903
I haven't seen you much
over the past few days.

00:32:26.941 --> 00:32:27.908
I miss you.

00:32:27.942 --> 00:32:31.434
All right, just for a while.

00:32:53.468 --> 00:32:54.696
Ensign Ayala to the Bridge.

00:32:54.735 --> 00:32:55.997
Go ahead, Ensign.

00:32:56.037 --> 00:32:57.868
You'd better come
down to the brig, ma'am.

00:32:59.474 --> 00:33:00.634
One.

00:33:03.311 --> 00:33:04.539
One.

00:33:13.488 --> 00:33:16.946
My designation
is Seven of Nine...

00:33:16.991 --> 00:33:21.257
but the others are gone.

00:33:21.295 --> 00:33:24.787
Designations are
no longer relevant.

00:33:27.301 --> 00:33:31.260
I am... one.

00:33:32.273 --> 00:33:33.968
Yes, you are.

00:33:34.075 --> 00:33:39.604
But I cannot function this way...
alone.

00:33:39.647 --> 00:33:40.614
You're not alone.

00:33:40.648 --> 00:33:42.275
I'm willing to help you.

00:33:44.385 --> 00:33:47.752
If that's true,
you won't do this to me.

00:33:47.788 --> 00:33:50.723
Take me back to my own kind.

00:33:50.758 --> 00:33:54.888
You are
with your own kind... humans.

00:33:54.929 --> 00:33:57.955
I don't remember being human.

00:33:57.999 --> 00:34:01.901
I don't know
what it is to be human.

00:34:15.850 --> 00:34:17.215
What are you doing?

00:34:17.251 --> 00:34:18.582
I'm coming in.

00:34:18.619 --> 00:34:20.746
I'll kill you.

00:34:22.390 --> 00:34:24.381
I don't think you will.

00:34:51.953 --> 00:34:54.444
Do you remember her?

00:34:54.488 --> 00:34:57.753
Her name was Annika Hansen.

00:34:57.792 --> 00:35:04.027
She was born on Stardate
25479 at the Tendara Colony.

00:35:04.065 --> 00:35:07.091
There's still a lot
we don't know about her.

00:35:07.134 --> 00:35:09.568
Did she have any siblings?

00:35:09.604 --> 00:35:10.832
Who were her friends?

00:35:10.871 --> 00:35:12.304
Where did she go to school?

00:35:12.340 --> 00:35:14.308
What was her favorite color?

00:35:19.981 --> 00:35:22.506
Irrelevant!

00:35:22.550 --> 00:35:25.075
Take me back to the Borg.

00:35:25.119 --> 00:35:26.484
I can't do that.

00:35:27.989 --> 00:35:30.287
So... quiet.

00:35:30.324 --> 00:35:31.484
One voice.

00:35:31.525 --> 00:35:35.962
One voice can be stronger
than a thousand voices.

00:35:36.030 --> 00:35:40.467
Your mind is independent now
with its own unique identity.

00:35:40.501 --> 00:35:43.197
You are forcing
that identity upon me.

00:35:43.237 --> 00:35:44.261
It's not mine.

00:35:44.305 --> 00:35:45.966
Oh, yes, it is.

00:35:46.007 --> 00:35:48.373
I'm just giving you back
what was stolen from you...

00:35:48.409 --> 00:35:50.639
the existence you were denied,

00:35:50.678 --> 00:35:52.305
the child
who never had a chance.

00:35:52.346 --> 00:35:54.507
That life is yours to live now.

00:35:54.548 --> 00:35:57.244
I don't want that life!

00:35:57.284 --> 00:35:58.649
It's what you are.

00:35:58.686 --> 00:35:59.846
Don't resist it.

00:35:59.887 --> 00:36:00.819
No!

00:36:07.795 --> 00:36:08.784
No.

00:36:16.636 --> 00:36:18.934
Captain's Log, supplemental.

00:36:19.038 --> 00:36:20.835
Warp drive is still off-line

00:36:20.873 --> 00:36:23.364
and we don't know whether
the Borg have detected us.

00:36:23.409 --> 00:36:26.845
Kes's psychokinetic abilities
continue to damage the ship's

00:36:26.879 --> 00:36:28.938
structural integrity,
and as a result,

00:36:29.048 --> 00:36:31.312
our defenses
have been compromised.

00:36:32.819 --> 00:36:34.912
Come in, Captain.

00:36:37.390 --> 00:36:39.381
You wanted to see me?

00:36:39.425 --> 00:36:42.861
Oh, Tuvok's meditation lamp.

00:36:42.895 --> 00:36:43.953
I was with him when he got it

00:36:44.030 --> 00:36:47.158
six years ago,
from a Vulcan master...

00:36:47.200 --> 00:36:49.725
who doubled the price when he
saw our Starfleet insignia.

00:36:49.769 --> 00:36:51.930
I'm sure it was
the logical thing to do.

00:36:55.875 --> 00:36:58.503
I've been thinking
about everything

00:36:58.544 --> 00:37:00.444
that's been going on...

00:37:00.480 --> 00:37:03.745
and I know what I have to do.

00:37:05.785 --> 00:37:08.083
It's time for me
to leave Voyager.

00:37:08.121 --> 00:37:09.679
Oh, Kes...

00:37:09.722 --> 00:37:11.553
Something important
is happening to me

00:37:11.591 --> 00:37:12.819
and I want to explore it,

00:37:12.859 --> 00:37:14.520
but I can't stay here
any longer.

00:37:14.560 --> 00:37:15.925
I'm a danger to all of you.

00:37:15.962 --> 00:37:17.930
We're going to get
to the bottom of this.

00:37:18.030 --> 00:37:21.022
The Doctor's already working
on a new approach...

00:37:21.067 --> 00:37:22.898
Everybody thinks
that what's happening

00:37:22.935 --> 00:37:24.095
is a medical condition.

00:37:24.137 --> 00:37:25.934
That's not it at all.

00:37:26.038 --> 00:37:28.438
I'm going through
a transformation.

00:37:28.474 --> 00:37:32.638
I don't know how or why,
but every cell in my body

00:37:32.678 --> 00:37:37.240
is telling me that I'm changing
into something more.

00:37:37.283 --> 00:37:39.444
But what if it's not true?

00:37:39.485 --> 00:37:41.146
What if you're simply
being swept up

00:37:41.187 --> 00:37:43.485
in the excitement
of what you think is happening,

00:37:43.523 --> 00:37:45.457
but it's not real.

00:37:45.491 --> 00:37:48.949
On the basis of a feeling,
an intuition,

00:37:48.995 --> 00:37:52.192
you're asking me to let you go?

00:37:52.231 --> 00:37:55.257
Quite likely forever?

00:37:55.301 --> 00:37:57.599
Kes, I just can't do that.

00:37:57.637 --> 00:38:02.472
It's my decision... my fate.

00:38:02.508 --> 00:38:04.999
Would you really try to stop me?

00:38:07.547 --> 00:38:10.141
No.

00:38:10.183 --> 00:38:11.480
But argue with you,

00:38:11.517 --> 00:38:13.280
even plead with you
to reconsider?

00:38:13.319 --> 00:38:16.049
Absolutely,
for as long as it takes.

00:38:18.958 --> 00:38:21.825
It won't work.

00:38:21.861 --> 00:38:24.557
Look at me, Captain.

00:38:24.597 --> 00:38:26.929
I'm the same Kes
you've always known.

00:38:27.033 --> 00:38:30.594
I haven't lost my judgment.

00:38:30.636 --> 00:38:34.538
I'm not under
some alien influence.

00:38:36.809 --> 00:38:40.939
I believe something crucial
is happening to me

00:38:40.980 --> 00:38:42.845
and I want to see it through.

00:38:45.117 --> 00:38:47.950
You've lived
most of your life here.

00:38:47.987 --> 00:38:50.785
Voyager has been your home...

00:38:52.658 --> 00:38:55.422
and you've been
a vital part of this family.

00:39:01.934 --> 00:39:03.595
Oh, I'm going to miss you.

00:39:17.250 --> 00:39:20.014
Now, all I have to do
is tell the Doctor.

00:39:20.052 --> 00:39:21.349
He's not going to be happy.

00:39:24.590 --> 00:39:26.114
It's starting.

00:39:27.159 --> 00:39:28.626
Janeway to Bridge.

00:39:28.661 --> 00:39:29.855
Chakotay here.

00:39:29.895 --> 00:39:31.260
Prepare a shuttle for launch

00:39:31.297 --> 00:39:33.595
and have Tuvok
meet me on Deck 6.

00:39:33.633 --> 00:39:35.123
Captain?

00:39:35.167 --> 00:39:36.634
Kes is leaving us.

00:39:45.411 --> 00:39:46.469
Come on.

00:39:46.512 --> 00:39:48.639
Captain, I can't stop it.

00:39:52.251 --> 00:39:53.718
Janeway to Chakotay.

00:39:53.753 --> 00:39:56.551
Beam us directly
to the Shuttle Bay.

00:39:56.589 --> 00:40:00.184
The molecules in Kes's body
are destabilizing.

00:40:00.226 --> 00:40:01.955
It's interfering
with the transporter.

00:40:01.994 --> 00:40:03.894
Captain, we can't get a lock.

00:40:03.929 --> 00:40:04.953
Acknowledged.

00:40:05.031 --> 00:40:07.431
Looks like we're going to have
to do this the hard way.

00:40:17.176 --> 00:40:18.336
What's happening?

00:40:18.377 --> 00:40:19.742
The hull is destabilizing.

00:40:19.779 --> 00:40:22.247
The molecular bonds
are breaking down.

00:40:25.318 --> 00:40:26.307
Tuvok...

00:40:32.458 --> 00:40:33.982
I can't keep going.

00:40:37.096 --> 00:40:38.427
I will attempt a mind-meld

00:40:38.464 --> 00:40:40.625
to help you delay
the transformation.

00:40:40.666 --> 00:40:43.635
Our minds are one.

00:40:46.105 --> 00:40:48.835
Our thoughts are one.

00:40:48.874 --> 00:40:52.207
Try to regain control...

00:40:52.244 --> 00:40:54.212
for a moment.

00:40:54.246 --> 00:40:56.714
Only for a moment.

00:40:56.749 --> 00:40:59.877
Only for... a moment.

00:41:04.990 --> 00:41:06.014
You must hurry.

00:41:10.563 --> 00:41:12.622
Hull breach on Decks 3, 4 and 5.

00:41:12.665 --> 00:41:14.792
Emergency containment fields.

00:41:14.834 --> 00:41:18.463
Janeway to the Bridge.
Kes is aboard the shuttle.

00:41:18.504 --> 00:41:19.698
Initiate launch sequence.

00:41:19.739 --> 00:41:21.730
Acknowledged.

00:41:26.278 --> 00:41:28.940
Shuttle distance:
100,000 kilometers.

00:41:28.981 --> 00:41:30.505
Speed: One-quarter impulse.

00:41:34.120 --> 00:41:35.382
Can you hail her?

00:41:35.421 --> 00:41:36.979
I've been trying.

00:41:37.056 --> 00:41:37.988
It's happening.

00:41:38.090 --> 00:41:40.888
It's happening to me.

00:41:40.926 --> 00:41:43.554
Her atomic structure
is completely destabilizing.

00:41:45.765 --> 00:41:47.232
My gift to you.

00:42:01.046 --> 00:42:01.944
Torres to Bridge.

00:42:02.047 --> 00:42:03.275
The warp core just came on-line.

00:42:03.315 --> 00:42:06.546
Matter/antimatter reaction
at 102 percent...

00:42:06.585 --> 00:42:08.815
110 percent?

00:42:08.854 --> 00:42:10.845
120!

00:42:14.660 --> 00:42:16.059
This can't be right.

00:42:16.095 --> 00:42:17.323
Our speed is...

00:42:17.363 --> 00:42:18.352
It's impossible!

00:42:19.432 --> 00:42:20.456
We're coming apart!

00:42:28.774 --> 00:42:31.140
We've just dropped out of...

00:42:31.177 --> 00:42:32.542
whatever it was we were in.

00:42:32.578 --> 00:42:34.375
Systems coming back on line.

00:42:34.413 --> 00:42:35.971
On screen.

00:42:38.884 --> 00:42:40.146
Where are we?

00:42:40.186 --> 00:42:44.589
9.5 thousand light-years
from where we just were.

00:42:48.093 --> 00:42:51.460
She's thrown us safely
beyond Borg space.

00:42:53.232 --> 00:42:55.700
Ten years closer to home.

00:43:19.592 --> 00:43:22.823
I've extracted 82 percent
of the Borg hardware.

00:43:22.862 --> 00:43:24.830
The remaining
bio-implants are stable

00:43:24.864 --> 00:43:27.196
and better than anything
I could synthesize

00:43:27.233 --> 00:43:28.427
at such short notice.

00:43:31.303 --> 00:43:33.362
It is acceptable.

00:43:33.405 --> 00:43:35.498
Fashion, of course,
is hardly my forte.

00:43:35.541 --> 00:43:37.975
Nevertheless, I've
managed to balance

00:43:38.043 --> 00:43:41.342
functionality and aesthetics
in a pleasing enough manner.

00:43:41.380 --> 00:43:42.438
I also took the liberty

00:43:42.481 --> 00:43:44.142
of stimulating
your hair follicles...

00:43:44.183 --> 00:43:47.277
a vicarious experience for me,
as you might imagine.

00:43:52.358 --> 00:43:54.121
You'll have to spend
a few hours each day

00:43:54.159 --> 00:43:56.184
regenerating in a Borg alcove
until your human

00:43:56.228 --> 00:43:57.786
metabolism can function
on its own.

00:43:57.830 --> 00:43:59.627
We'll leave one operational.

00:43:59.665 --> 00:44:00.893
Understood.

00:44:02.167 --> 00:44:04.465
Let's see how things go
over the next few weeks.

00:44:04.503 --> 00:44:08.303
I'll consider granting you
access to the rest of the ship

00:44:08.340 --> 00:44:10.308
once I can trust
that you won't try

00:44:10.342 --> 00:44:12.242
to get us all assimilated again.

00:44:13.812 --> 00:44:15.143
It will not happen again.

00:44:17.550 --> 00:44:20.178
Good.

00:44:20.219 --> 00:44:23.382
If you need anything,
contact me.

00:44:27.826 --> 00:44:29.088
Red.

00:44:29.128 --> 00:44:30.618
What?

00:44:30.663 --> 00:44:34.099
The child you spoke of...
the girl.

00:44:34.133 --> 00:44:36.761
Her favorite color was red.
